        <mxCell id="n" value="The dashed line splits the DTO in two. Important values form the &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#ffb066;border-radius:3px;&quot;&gt;public half&lt;/span&gt;: its published shape, which others depend on and the hash guards. Unimportant values form the &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#d4d4d4;border-radius:3px;&quot;&gt;private half&lt;/span&gt;: they only decide how the code is written, so you can change them at any time." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
